    "reviewed_findings": [
      "Player-facing README states the magazine-based step S=max(1,floor(M*0.05)), five-stack cap, shot-count timing before hit processing, miss/multitarget behavior, current-slot gate, reload zero step, and strict current-spread timeout consistently with the pinned source receipts.",
      "The two movement stats reduce their respective existing slow amplitudes by multiplicative residuals r^n; they do not grant global movement speed. Tier residuals match: Arc Rifle and Braced Autogun I-IV 0.90/0.85/0.80/0.75; Heavy Stubber 0.93/0.92/0.91/0.90.",
      "Shared shooting_status, cross-weapon shots while the count survives, no reset on slot switch, current-template timeout, and the Autogun P2 Mk I ADS selection of the P3 ADS spread template are described accurately; reload step is zero and buff cache timing is not promised retroactively.",
      "Both controlled examples recompute correctly under their stated neutral-other-modifier premises: 0.40*0.85^4=0.2088025 (20.88% remaining slow) and 0.40*0.90^5=0.236196 (23.62% remaining slow); the text distinguishes percentage-point and relative reductions.",
      "All three variant pages, the compatibility table, and map entries agree on the seven actual bindings and model labels: Arc Rifle Branx Mk IV; Braced Autogun Vraks Mk II, Graia Mk IV, Agripinaa Mk VIII; Twin-Linked Heavy Stubber Krourk Mk V, Gorgonum Mk IV, Achlys Mk VII. The three reverse weapon indexes link to the matching variants.",
      "The bilingual RAW pair and SHA are exact. The formatter reconstruction preserves the actual minus prefix, fixed 5% ammo/5-stack values, and tier-dependent outputs; the formal comparison correctly separates formatter text from runtime slow-residual behavior and treats omitted boundaries as not covered rather than a contradiction.",
      "Map association has 3 variants and 7 bindings with the ranged kind, exact trait IDs, item paths, and common icon 113. README attachment URL matches the accepted image receipt; the image identification path and attachment URL are not conflated.",
      "The pinned scope itself and all 70 listed files were hash-verified with Windows long-path handling; the fixed focused-check receipt reports new link errors 0 and GFM checks passed."
    ],
